      *------------------------------------------------------------------------
      * PrintDoc - Print a document
      *------------------------------------------------------------------------
     D PrintDoc        PR                  extpgm('SC982C')
     D  docID                        10a
     D  folder                       10a
     D  outq                         10a
     D  path                        100a
     D  output_type                   1a
     D  rtnCode                       1a

      *------------------------------------------------------------------------
      * PrintFax - Print a fax
      *------------------------------------------------------------------------
     D PrintFax        PR                  extpgm('PRTFAXC')
     D  lfm                          30a

      *------------------------------------------------------------------------
      * GetOptical - Get the information for a document on optical
      *------------------------------------------------------------------------
     D GetOptical      PR                  extpgm('SC871R ')
     D  key                          40a
     D  seq                           3a
     D  docid                        10a
     D  folder                       10a
     D  rtnCode                       1a

      *------------------------------------------------------------------------
      * Output_proc - Output processing
      *------------------------------------------------------------------------
     D Output_proc     pr                  extpgm('SC982C1')
     D  path                        100a
     D  output_type                   1a
